# CMDEDIT-HIER-09: save adder from (UNNAMED); writeall force; flush a -noprompt.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/tiny -noprompt
box 0 0 10 10
paint metal1
save adder
load b
box 0 0 5 5
paint metal1
writeall force
load a
box 0 0 5 5
paint poly
flush a -noprompt
cellname list modified
